 rich but she doesn’t let that show."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Anime History"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c990"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7ae048e3d1c6c4f12bd522ec46eca33bb809a7d4337ef9c7cfd9aa6798311ba3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e997846625fadd078bd062da6da654ba6aaffbf73c74ae2a57e7f27c63605b77.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"紫苑 みやび","creatorId":"vndb:s632","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s632","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s632","name":"紫苑 みやび","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:798","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c991","characterName":"宗谷 美里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c991"},"originalCharacterName":"宗谷 美里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"78"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuuji's homeroom teacher and Misaki’s older sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she is a teacher, she tends to hang around with Yuuji and co. on their get-togethers and generally tends to act as “one of the guys”. She likes to get drunk once in a while and generally is a complete ditz."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Anime History"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c991"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c